## What the docs say

README, Commands table:

> `/ponytail [lite | full | ultra | off]` — Set the intensity, or turn it off. **No argument reports the current level.**

## What happens

That holds on Claude Code, where `hooks/ponytail-mode-tracker.js` treats a bare `/ponytail` as report-only:

